    string v11HtfState = not v11UseHtfSource ? "未启用" : not v11HtfOn ? "上级周期无效（须大于本图）" : v11HtfText + " · " + (na(v11LastHtfBreakTime) ? "尚无突破" : "最近突破可见 " + str.format_time(v11LastHtfBreakTime, "MM-dd HH:mm", "Asia/Shanghai")) + " · " + v11HtfPairWhy
    table.cell(panel, 0, 11, "上级周期 · " + v112Rule, text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 11, v11HtfState, text_color=v11HtfColor, text_size=size.tiny)

    if v112ShowAllLines
        table.cell(panel, 0, 12, "诊断 · 最近一次找线", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
        table.cell(panel, 1, 12, v10SearchWhy + " · 当前候选 " + str.tostring(v10ActiveCount), text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)

    string latestBreakText = na(v12LastBreakTime) or na(v11LastBroken) ? "尚无突破" : str.format_time(v12LastBreakTime, "MM-dd HH:mm", "Asia/Shanghai") + " · " + f_v12_kindText(v11LastBroken)
    table.cell(panel, 0, 13, "最近本周期突破 · 北京", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 13, latestBreakText, text_color=v10BreakColor, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 0, 14, "V12 局部回踩找线", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 14, v12LocalEnabled ? v12SearchWhy : "未启用", text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)

    table.cell(panel, 0, 15, "本周期结构参数（K数）", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 15, timeframe.period + " · 高点 " + str.tostring(v10Left) + "/" + str.tostring(v10Right) + " · 间隔 " + str.tostring(v10Gap) + " · 跨度 " + str.tostring(v10Span) + " · 持线待V9 " + str.tostring(array.size(v12Held) + array.size(v12HeldHtf)), text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)

    // BEGIN CONFIRMED H1 SMA60 PANEL
    string h1SmaStatus = not useH1Sma60 ? "关闭" : not h1SmaApplies ? "仅15m启用" : not h1SmaReady ? "等待完整60小时" : str.tostring(h1Sma60, format.mintick) + (close > h1Sma60 ? " · 仅允许多头" : close < h1Sma60 ? " · 仅允许空头" : " · 等于均线，暂停入场")
    table.cell(panel, 0, 16, "15m · 1h SMA60", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(panel, 1, 16, h1SmaStatus, text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)
    // END CONFIRMED H1 SMA60 PANEL
    // BEGIN CONFIRMED M15 EMA120 PANEL
    if timeframe.isminutes and timeframe.multiplier == 5
        string m15EmaStatus = not useM15Ema120 ? "关闭" : not m15EmaReady ? "等待完整15m历史" : str.tostring(m15Ema120, format.mintick) + (close > m15Ema120 ? " · 收盘在线上才允许多头" : close < m15Ema120 ? " · 收盘在线下才允许空头" : " · 等于均线，暂停入场")
        table.cell(panel, 0, 16, "5m · 15m EMA120", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
        table.cell(panel, 1, 16, m15EmaStatus, text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)
    // END CONFIRMED M15 EMA120 PANEL

// ───────────── 原有结构与参考预警 ─────────────

// “仅显示”不改变这些预警条件。
// 只接收联合通知时，创建预警应选择“突破+spike 联合确认”。
alertcondition(not v130Retest and signalSide != 0, "SPIKE V13.0 原版 结构确认", "SPIKE V13.0 原版 结构确认 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 实际确认收盘 {{close}}")

alertcondition(not v130Retest and confirmedSignal, "SPIKE V13.0 原版 多头结构确认", "SPIKE V13.0 原版 多头结构确认 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 实际确认收盘 {{close}}")

alertcondition(not v130Retest and confirmedShortSignal, "SPIKE V13.0 原版 空头结构确认", "SPIKE V13.0 原版 空头结构确认 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 实际确认收盘 {{close}}")

alertcondition(not v130Retest and v112EarlyExitNow, "SPIKE V13.0 原版 未突破离场", "SPIKE V13.0 原版 多头框N根内未出突破，参考结束 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 收盘 {{close}}")

alertcondition(not v130Retest and exitReference and not referenceReverse and not v112EarlyExitNow, "SPIKE V13.0 原版参考保护触及", "SPIKE V13.0 原版参考保护已触及 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 已收盘确认，请查看参考价")

alertcondition(not v130Retest and referenceReverse, "SPIKE V13.0 原版参考反向结束", "SPIKE V13.0 原版参考反向结束 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 反向确认收盘 {{close}}")
// BEGIN V128 ALERT
// Chart notification only: no order, sizing, protection, or exit action follows.
alertcondition(not v130Retest and v128CandidateEvent, "SPIKE V13.0 原版 加仓候选（图表提示）", "SPIKE V13.0 原版 加仓候选 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 收盘 {{close}} | 图表提示，未核验整仓净利润、保证金或实际成交；原ATR保护/退出不变")
// END V128 ALERT

// BEGIN V130 RETEST CORE
// Source: spike_v128_retest_state.confirmation; only completed chart bars.
// Pine execution/rollback: https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/execution-model/
// Stage 0=breakout, 1=retest, 2=rebreak. Result 0=pending, 1=confirmed,
// 2=expired, 3=gap, 4=opposite, 5=stop, 6=lost level, 7=invalid anchor open.
f_v130_step(int stage, float extreme, int side, float level, float stop, int age, float o, float h, float l, float c, bool gap, int rawSide, int limit) =>
    int nextStage = stage
    float nextExtreme = extreme
    int result = 0
    if gap
        result := 3
    else if age == 1 and (o <= 0 or side * (o - stop) <= 0)
        result := 7
    else if rawSide == -side
        result := 4
    else if (side == 1 ? l <= stop : h >= stop)
        result := 5
    else if stage > 0 and side * (c - level) <= 0
        result := 6
    else if age > limit
        result := 2
    else if stage == 0
        if side * (c - level) > 0
            nextStage := 1
            nextExtreme := side == 1 ? h : l
    else if stage == 1
        if (side == 1 ? l <= level : h >= level)
            nextStage := 2
        else
            nextExtreme := side == 1 ? math.max(extreme, h) : math.min(extreme, l)
    else if side * (c - extreme) > 0
        result := 1
    if result == 0 and age >= limit
        result := 2
    [nextStage, nextExtreme, result]

type V130Candidate
    int anchor
    int anchorTime
    int side
    float level
    float stop
    int stage = 0
    float extreme = na
    int breakout = na
    int retest = na

f_v130_reason(int code) =>
    code == 2 ? "24根到期" : code == 3 ? "数据断档" : code == 4 ? "原始反向信号" : code == 5 ? "原止损触及" : code == 6 ? "收盘失守原价位" : code == 7 ? "原次开风险无效" : "等待确认"
// END V130 RETEST CORE

// BEGIN V130 RETEST LAYER
// Keep the parent's candidate/reference engine intact: its state defines joint
// anchors. Feeding delayed entries into that engine would change the hypothesis.
// Objects persist at closed bars; no varip state or retrospective arrow offsets.
// Source: https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/objects/
var array<V130Candidate> v130Queue = array.new<V130Candidate>()
var V130Candidate v130Scheduled = na
var int v130ScheduledBar = na
var int v130Side = 0
var int v130EntryBar = na
var float v130Entry = na
var float v130InitialStop = na
var float v130Risk = na
var float v130Protection = na
var float v130Peak = 0.0
var bool v130Armed = false
var bool v130ReversePending = false
var string v130LastStatus = "等待原始候选"
var int v130LastAnchor = na
var int v130LastConfirm = na
var float v130LastConfirmPrice = na
var int v130ConfirmedCount = 0
var int v130OccupiedCount = 0
var int v130CanceledCount = 0
var int v130FillCount = 0
var array<label> v130Tags = array.new<label>()
var array<box> v130Boxes = array.new<box>()
var box v130RiskBox = na
var box v130RewardBox = na
bool v130Confirmed = false
int v130ConfirmedSide = 0
bool v130Entered = false
bool v130Exited = false
bool v130GapEnded = false
float v130ExitPrice = na
float v130ExitNetR = na
string v130ExitReason = ""
float v130BarProtection = v130Side != 0 ? v130Protection : na

// Evaluate stop geometry at the ORIGINAL anchor close, including that bar's
// five-bar extreme and ATR. The next open validates risk but never moves stop.
[v130LongStop, v130LongRisk, v130LongValid] = f_risk(1, close, recentLow, atr, riskFloor, stopBuffer, syminfo.mintick)
[v130ShortStop, v130ShortRisk, v130ShortValid] = f_risk(-1, close, recentHigh, atr, riskFloor, stopBuffer, syminfo.mintick)
int v130BarsSinceGap = ta.barssince(dataGap)
// The original five-bar window rejects a gap even at its oldest included bar.
bool v130StopHistoryValid = pricesValid and bar_index >= stopLen - 1 and (na(v130BarsSinceGap) or v130BarsSinceGap >= stopLen)

if v130Retest and barstate.isconfirmed
    if dataGap or not pricesValid
        v130GapEnded := v130Side != 0
        v130Side := 0
        v130ReversePending := false
        v130Scheduled := na
        array.clear(v130Queue)
        v130LastStatus := "数据断档：等待新候选"
        if not na(v130RiskBox)
            box.set_right(v130RiskBox, bar_index - 1)
            box.set_right(v130RewardBox, bar_index - 1)
            v130RiskBox := na
            v130RewardBox := na
    else
        // A raw opposite CLOSE schedules exit at the following OPEN. A gap
        // through protection uses that open too, before the new bar's range.
        if v130Side != 0 and v130ReversePending
            v130Exited := true
            v130ExitPrice := open
            v130ExitReason := (v130Side == 1 ? open <= v130Protection : open >= v130Protection) ? "开盘越过保护" : "原始反向后次开"
            v130ReversePending := false

        // A selected confirmation only becomes a reference on its next bar.
        // This is a modelled open, not a broker fill. Rollback repeats the same
        // deterministic operation on each realtime update; no intrabar commit.
        if not na(v130Scheduled) and bar_index == v130ScheduledBar + 1 and v130Side == 0
            float distance = v130Scheduled.side * (open - v130Scheduled.stop)
            if open > 0 and distance > 0
                v130Side := v130Scheduled.side
                v130EntryBar := bar_index
                v130Entry := open
                v130InitialStop := v130Scheduled.stop
                v130Risk := distance
                v130Protection := v130InitialStop
                v130BarProtection := v130InitialStop
                v130Peak := 0.0
                v130Armed := false
                v130ReversePending := false
                v130Entered := true
                v130FillCount += 1
                v130LastStatus := "次开参考已建立"
                if v130ShowRisk and not v126Minimal
                    while array.size(v130Boxes) >= 40
                        box.delete(array.shift(v130Boxes))
                    float target = math.max(syminfo.mintick, v130Entry + v130Side * 3.0 * v130Risk)
                    v130RiskBox := box.new(bar_index, math.max(v130Entry, v130InitialStop), bar_index + 1, math.min(v130Entry, v130InitialStop), border_color=color.new(bear, 55), bgcolor=color.new(bear, 93), force_overlay=true)
                    v130RewardBox := box.new(bar_index, math.max(v130Entry, target), bar_index + 1, math.min(v130Entry, target), border_color=color.new(bull, 65), bgcolor=color.new(bull, 95), force_overlay=true)
                    array.push(v130Boxes, v130RiskBox)
                    array.push(v130Boxes, v130RewardBox)
                if showLabels and not v126Minimal
                    string tip = "原信号：" + str.format_time(v130Scheduled.anchorTime, "MM-dd HH:mm", "Asia/Shanghai") + " 北京时间\n原冻结价位：" + str.tostring(v130Scheduled.level, format.mintick) + "\n原绝对止损：" + str.tostring(v130InitialStop, format.mintick) + "\n次开模型参考：" + str.tostring(open, format.mintick) + "\n初始风险：" + str.tostring(v130Risk, format.mintick) + "\n不是账户成交；止损不移到回踩低点。"
                    array.push(v130Tags, label.new(bar_index, open, "次开 " + str.tostring(open, format.mintick), style=v130Side == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color=color.new(v130Side == 1 ? bull : bear, 86), textcolor=v130Side == 1 ? bull : bear, size=size.tiny, tooltip=tip, force_overlay=true))
            else
                v130LastStatus := "确认后次开风险无效"
        v130Scheduled := na

        // Include the ENTRY bar. Test the protection already active at its
        // open before close-based 2R activation / 4ATR ratcheting for NEXT bar.
        if v130Side != 0 and not v130Exited
            bool stopTouched = v130Side == 1 ? low <= v130Protection : high >= v130Protection
            if stopTouched
                v130Exited := true
                v130ExitPrice := v130Side == 1 ? math.min(open, v130Protection) : math.max(open, v130Protection)
                v130ExitReason := "保护触及"
            else
                v130Peak := math.max(v130Peak, v130Side * ((v130Side == 1 ? high : low) - v130Entry) / v130Risk)
                float closeR = v130Side * (close - v130Entry) / v130Risk
                v130Armed := v130Armed or closeR >= armR
                if v130Armed and atr > 0
                    float rawProtection = close - v130Side * trailAtr * atr
                    float nextProtection = v130Side == 1 ? math.floor(rawProtection / syminfo.mintick) * syminfo.mintick : math.ceil(rawProtection / syminfo.mintick) * syminfo.mintick
                    v130Protection := v130Side == 1 ? math.max(v130Protection, nextProtection) : math.min(v130Protection, nextProtection)
                v130ReversePending := rawSignalSide == -v130Side

        if v130Side != 0 and not na(v130RiskBox)
            box.set_right(v130RiskBox, bar_index + (v130Exited ? 0 : 1))
            box.set_right(v130RewardBox, bar_index + (v130Exited ? 0 : 1))
        if v130Exited
            v130ExitNetR := (v130Side * (v130ExitPrice / v130Entry - 1) - roundTripCost) * v130Entry / v130Risk
            v130LastStatus := v130ExitReason + " · 净 " + str.tostring(v130ExitNetR, "#.##") + "R"
            if v130ShowRisk and not v126Minimal
                array.push(v130Tags, label.new(bar_index, v130ExitPrice, "结束 " + str.tostring(v130ExitNetR, "#.##") + "R", style=label.style_none, textcolor=v130ExitNetR > 0 ? bull : bear, size=size.tiny, tooltip=v130ExitReason + "；扣固定0.2%往返成本的模型净R，不是账户收益。", force_overlay=true))
            v130Side := 0
            v130ReversePending := false
            v130RiskBox := na
            v130RewardBox := na

        // Oldest anchor wins simultaneous confirmations. Every anchor advances
        // independently, including during an existing position; occupied
        // confirmations expire rather than being carried to a later free bar.
        int q = 0
        while q < array.size(v130Queue)
            V130Candidate item = array.get(v130Queue, q)
            int age = bar_index - item.anchor
            [stage, extreme, result] = f_v130_step(item.stage, item.extreme, item.side, item.level, item.stop, age, open, high, low, close, false, rawSignalSide, V130_WAIT)
            if stage == 1 and item.stage == 0
                item.breakout := bar_index
            if stage == 2 and item.stage == 1
                item.retest := bar_index
            item.stage := stage
            item.extreme := extreme
            if result == 1
                if v130Side == 0 and na(v130Scheduled)
                    v130Scheduled := item.copy()
                    v130ScheduledBar := bar_index
                    v130Confirmed := true
                    v130ConfirmedSide := item.side
                    v130ConfirmedCount += 1
                    v130LastAnchor := item.anchorTime
                    v130LastConfirm := time_close
                    v130LastConfirmPrice := close
                    v130LastStatus := "回踩再突破已确认；等待次开"
                    if showLabels and not v126Minimal
                        string tip = "回踩再突破确认，尚未成交。\n原信号：" + str.format_time(item.anchorTime, "MM-dd HH:mm", "Asia/Shanghai") + " 北京时间\n等待：" + str.tostring(age) + "根\n冻结价位：" + str.tostring(item.level, format.mintick) + "\n首段极值：" + str.tostring(item.extreme, format.mintick) + "\n确认收盘：" + str.tostring(close, format.mintick) + "\n下一根开盘建立模型参考；三个步骤不同K线。"
                        array.push(v130Tags, label.new(bar_index, item.side == 1 ? low - atr * 0.4 : high + atr * 0.4, (item.side == 1 ? "回踩多" : "回踩空") + " · " + str.tostring(close, format.mintick), style=item.side == 1 ? label.style_label_up : label.style_label_down, color=color.new(item.side == 1 ? bull : bear, 80), textcolor=item.side == 1 ? bull : bear, size=size.small, tooltip=tip, force_overlay=true))
                else
                    v130OccupiedCount += 1
            else if result > 1
                v130CanceledCount += 1
                if v130Side == 0 and na(v130Scheduled)
                    v130LastStatus := f_v130_reason(result)
            if result != 0
                array.remove(v130Queue, q)
            else
                q += 1

        int anchorSide = v130Arm == "联合多头" ? (v11AnyJoint ? 1 : 0) : signalSide
        bool anchorValid = anchorSide == 1 ? v130LongValid : anchorSide == -1 ? v130ShortValid : false
        if anchorSide != 0 and anchorValid and v130StopHistoryValid
            array.push(v130Queue, V130Candidate.new(bar_index, time_close, anchorSide, anchorSide == 1 ? high : low, anchorSide == 1 ? v130LongStop : v130ShortStop))

    while array.size(v130Tags) > 60
        label.delete(array.shift(v130Tags))

float v130WaitingLevel = array.size(v130Queue) > 0 ? array.get(v130Queue, 0).level : na
float v130WaitingExtreme = array.size(v130Queue) > 0 ? array.get(v130Queue, 0).extreme : na
// Separate break segments: avoid drawing a diagonal from an ended reference.
plot(v130Retest and v130ShowRisk and not v126Minimal and (v130Side != 0 or v130Exited) ? v130BarProtection : na, "V13 本根有效保护", color=bear, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
plot(v130Retest and v130ShowRisk and not v126Minimal and (v130Side != 0 or v130Exited) ? v130Entry : na, "V13 次开参考价", color=ink, style=plot.style_linebr, force_overlay=true)
plot(v130Retest and v130ShowLevels and not v126Minimal ? v130WaitingLevel : na, "V13 待确认原价位", color=color.new(gold, 35), style=plot.style_circles, force_overlay=true)
plot(v130Retest and v130ShowLevels and not v126Minimal ? v130WaitingExtreme : na, "V13 首段极值", color=color.new(blue, 45), style=plot.style_circles, force_overlay=true)
plot(v130Retest and barstate.isconfirmed ? v130ConfirmedSide : na, "V13 回踩确认方向", display=display.data_window)
plot(v130Retest and barstate.isconfirmed ? (v130Entered ? 1 : 0) : na, "V13 次开参考事件", display=display.data_window)
plot(v130Retest and barstate.isconfirmed ? v130ExitNetR : na, "V13 结束净R（固定20bp）", display=display.data_window)

var table v130Panel = table.new(position.bottom_center, 2, 4, bgcolor=color.new(chart.bg_color, 8))
if barstate.islast and v130Retest and showPanel
    table.cell(v130Panel, 0, 0, "V13.0 · " + v130Arm, text_color=ink, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 1, 0, v130LastStatus, text_color=v130Side == 0 ? gold : bull, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 0, 1, "等待 / 已确认 / 次开", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 1, 1, str.tostring(array.size(v130Queue)) + " / " + str.tostring(v130ConfirmedCount) + " / " + str.tostring(v130FillCount), text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 0, 2, "最近确认 · 北京", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 1, 2, na(v130LastConfirm) ? "—" : str.format_time(v130LastConfirm, "MM-dd HH:mm", "Asia/Shanghai") + " · " + str.tostring(v130LastConfirmPrice, format.mintick), text_color=ink, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 0, 3, "等待上限 / 历史研究", text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(v130Panel, 1, 3, "24根 · " + (timeframe.in_seconds() == 900 or timeframe.in_seconds() == 3600 ? "15m与1h已研究" : "本周期未回测"), text_color=muted, text_size=size.tiny)

// Confirmed-bar alerts notify the decision, never a historical/actual fill.
// Source: https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/concepts/bar-states/#barstateisconfirmed
alertcondition(v130Retest and v130Confirmed, "SPIKE V13.0 回踩再突破确认", "SPIKE V13.0 回踩再突破确认 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 确认收盘 {{close}} | 下一根开盘模型参考，非账户成交")
alertcondition(v130Retest and v130ConfirmedSide == 1, "SPIKE V13.0 回踩多头", "SPIKE V13.0 回踩多头确认 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 收盘 {{close}}")
alertcondition(v130Retest and v130ConfirmedSide == -1, "SPIKE V13.0 回踩空头", "SPIKE V13.0 回踩空头确认 | {{exchange}}:{{ticker}} | {{interval}} | 收盘 {{close}}")
// END V130 RETEST LAYER
